{"surah":91,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسِ وَضُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هَارِ إِذَا جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَّٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">شَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءِ وَمَا بَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>هَا","وَنَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">سٍ وَ</span>مَا سَوَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَا","فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَا","قَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> أَفْلَحَ مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن زَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَّٰ</span>هَا","وَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> خَابَ مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن دَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَّٰ</span>هَا","كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَآ","إِذِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">نۢبَ</span>عَثَ أَشْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">قَٰ</span>هَا","فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ نَاقَةَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَسُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>هَا","فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa_shafawi\">هُم بِ</span>ذَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">نۢبِ</span>هِمْ فَسَوَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَا","وَلَا يَخَافُ عُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">بَٰ</span>هَا"]}